---
---

<section id="specialist-fleet" class="py-20 bg-[#0b1120] border-t border-slate-800">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      <!-- Text & Spec Overview -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-amber-500/30 bg-amber-500/10 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-400 mb-4">
          <span>Heavy Transport Equipment</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight mb-6">
          Purpose-Built Transporters & High-Reach Hiab Cranes
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Moving mobile homes and park units requires specialized machinery that general freight carriers do not possess. Our heavy haulage fleet utilizes custom extendable step-frame trailers with air-ride pneumatic suspension to protect internal cabinetry, fixtures, and structural window glazing from highway vibrations.
        </p>

        <dl class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="border-l-3 border-amber-500 pl-4 bg-slate-900/40 py-3 pr-3 rounded-r-lg">
            <dt class="font-extrabold text-white text-base">Extendable Step-Deck Beds</dt>
            <dd class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Accommodating chassis lengths up to 50ft and unit widths exceeding standard highway limits without road contact.</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="border-l-3 border-amber-500 pl-4 bg-slate-900/40 py-3 pr-3 rounded-r-lg">
            <dt class="font-extrabold text-white text-base">High-Tonnage Winching</dt>
            <dd class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Industrial hydraulic winches and heavy dollies for controlled loading of non-rolling, bogged, or seized chassis.</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="border-l-3 border-amber-500 pl-4 bg-slate-900/40 py-3 pr-3 rounded-r-lg">
            <dt class="font-extrabold text-white text-base">Truck-Mounted Hiab Cranes</dt>
            <dd class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">High-reach cranes operated via remote belly-packs for laser precision placement over boundary walls, hedges, and ditches.</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="border-l-3 border-amber-500 pl-4 bg-slate-900/40 py-3 pr-3 rounded-r-lg">
            <dt class="font-extrabold text-white text-base">Goods-in-Transit Insured</dt>
            <dd class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Comprehensive Goods in Transit, Public Liability, and project-specific Method Statements & Risk Assessments (RAMS).</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>

      <!-- Compliance & Escort Callout Box -->
      <div id="permits" class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/90 p-8 shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute -top-12 -right-12 h-36 w-36 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 blur-2xl"></div>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-white mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="flex h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span>
            Abnormal Load Permits & Escorts
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-amber-400 font-mono mb-6">ESDAL NOTIFIED • STATUTORY POLICE ESCORTS</p>

          <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Transporting loads exceeding 2.9 meters width requires statutory advance notifications to highway authorities, regional police constabularies, and bridge owners. We handle 100% of the administration and deploy Chapter 8 pilot cars.
          </p>

          <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Bridge weight & swept-path height clearance surveys</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Chapter 8 compliant warning escort vehicles & beacons</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Holiday park pitch turning circle feasibility audits</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Direct dispatch hotline: 07764 341657</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Dedicated Failed Move Rescue Banner -->
        <div id="rescue" class="rounded-2xl border-2 border-red-500/50 bg-gradient-to-br from-red-950/40 via-slate-900 to-slate-950 p-6 shadow-xl relative">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
            <span class="flex h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-red-500 animate-ping"></span>
            <h4 class="text-lg font-black text-white">Failed Move Rescue Unit</h4>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-red-200 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Has another haulier broken down, damaged a chassis, or left your unit stranded on the road? Call our emergency recovery dispatch immediately for rapid deployment.
          </p>
          <a
            href="tel:+447764341657"
            class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-500 py-2.5 px-4 text-xs font-black text-white transition-all shadow-md shadow-red-600/30"
          >
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z" />
            </svg>
            <span>Emergency Rescue Line: 07764 341657</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
